What a bundle carries
------------------------------------------------------------------------

None of this is in Hoshi's source repository. MANIFEST.txt in each bundle
records the exact versions, digests and checksums of what that bundle holds.

1. LibreTranslate
   The translation server, its web page and its document translation.

   By the LibreTranslate contributors.
   GNU Affero General Public License, version 3.
   https://github.com/LibreTranslate/LibreTranslate

   A bundle carries the official image libretranslate/libretranslate from
   Docker Hub, at the version MANIFEST.txt names, with language models added
   to it by Hoshi's Dockerfile. Nothing else in the image is changed. The
   program's source is inside the image, under /app, and at the address
   above under the same version tag.

   The image also holds these, under the same licence, by the same project:
     argos-translate-files   https://github.com/LibreTranslate/argos-translate-files
     LexiLang                https://github.com/LibreTranslate/LexiLang
     MiniSBD                 https://github.com/LibreTranslate/MiniSBD

   "LibreTranslate" is a trademark. Its use is governed by
   https://github.com/LibreTranslate/LibreTranslate/blob/main/TRADEMARK.md

2. Argos Translate
   The translation engine inside LibreTranslate.

   Copyright (c) 2020 Argos Open Technologies, LLC.
   MIT License, or Creative Commons CC0, at your choice.
   https://github.com/argosopentech/argos-translate

   It runs its models with:
     CTranslate2     OpenNMT. MIT License.
                     https://github.com/OpenNMT/CTranslate2
     SentencePiece   Google. Apache License 2.0.
                     https://github.com/google/sentencepiece
